# Zoho WorkDrive — team deliverables (manual upload)

**Agents (desktop · cloud):** After Phase 3, leave the pack in **git** under `apps/siya-health/brand/editorial-packs/[ID]/` or `statics/[ID]/`. State the folder path. **Do not** auto-sync to WorkDrive (TrueSync path, API, fuse script, or GitHub Action) unless the user explicitly asks for a one-off mirror.

**Humans / team:** Download from git and upload into:

```text
~/Library/CloudStorage/ZohoWorkDriveTrueSync-AmcareMedicalConsultancyIndiaPvtLtd/Common Folder/Siya Knowledge Editorial/
```

